OL,3,ATrump says US has 'historic' deal to
OL,4,Acontrol 65bn barrels of Venezuela's oil
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has reached a deal with
OL,7,FVenezuela to control more than 65
OL,8,Fbillion barrels of its proven oil
OL,9,Freserves, President Donald Trump
OL,10,Fannounced.
OL,12,F"This Historic Transaction MORE THAN
OL,13,FDOUBLES American Oil Reserves, greatly
OL,14,Fincreases our Oil Supply, and will
OL,15,Fsubstantially lower Gas Prices for all
OL,16,FAmericans," Trump posted on social
OL,17,Fmedia.
OL,19,FVenezuela's interim President, Delcy
OL,20,FRodriguez, hailed the agreement as one
OL,21,Fthat would help her nation's economic
OL,22,Frevival.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
